usage: runsieve [-h]
                {capture,reduce,minimize,materialize,replay,reproduce-predicate,verify-minimal,export} ...

Capture and reduce a failed agent run into an offline reproduction.

positional arguments:
  {capture,reduce,minimize,materialize,replay,reproduce-predicate,verify-minimal,export}
    capture             capture one OpenAI Agents SDK trace
    reduce              reduce a capsule with a predicate
    minimize            deprecated alias for reduce
    materialize         write deterministic recorded model and tool values
    replay              deprecated alias for materialize
    reproduce-predicate
                        run an offline predicate against recorded values
    verify-minimal      independently verify 1-minimality
    export              write a one-command issue reproduction

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
